 "notes": "Java/Kotlin View-based app: screens are Activities + Fragments switched by TAG in MainActivity. No Compose testTag; testids here are android:id resource-ids used by Espresso (kind=resource-id). Gpodnet APIs are built with String.format + new URI so paths contain placeholders. wear:// intent-filters in app/src/play and app-wearos belong to WearableListenerService (MESSAGE_RECEIVED), not deep links -> excluded."
